get.description:
Requires finance.view. Current farm only; newest occurred_on first. Reversal rows are included (entry_type=reversal);
filter with entry_type=entry to hide them. from/to are inclusive farm-local days on occurred_on.

**Requires farm permission:** `finance.view`.

put.description:
Body: `{ "channels": { "in_app": true, "email": false } }`. Omitted channels keep their value (and per-type switches are untouched);
unknown channels are a `422`. Equivalent to `PATCH /notification-preferences` with only `channels`.

**Requires farm permission:** `farm.view`.

get.description:
Requires sale.view. Each stock line names the inventory movement it caused, each livestock line the population record;
the live invoice and its balance are summarised.

**Requires farm permission:** `sale.view`.
